  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "SA-Med3D-140K",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSA-Med3D-140K [github]\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nSA-Med3D-140K is a large-scale, multi-modal, multi-anatomical volumetric medical image segmentation dataset. It was created to facilitate the development of general-purpose foundation models for 3D medical image segmentation. \nThe dataset comprises 21,729 3D medical images and 143,518 corresponding masks. \nIt was gathered from a combination of 70 public datasets and 8,128 privately licensed annotated cases from 24 hospitals.\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/blueyo0/SA-Med3D-140K.",
